# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** Before reading this guide, you should read the [Truncate Pauli terms](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/truncate-operator-terms) guide, which describes the truncation of low-weight Pauli terms that is built into the [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) method based on a specified [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget).\n"
"In this guide, you will learn about the [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) keyword argument, `p_norm`, which can be used to change the Lp-norm used to estimate the error incurred by the truncated Pauli terms.\n"
msgstr ""
"**注意:** このガイドを読む前に、[Truncate Pauli terms](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/truncate-operator-terms)ガイドをお読みください。そのガイドでは、指定された[TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget)に基づいて[backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate)メソッドに組み込まれている、低ウェイトのPauli項の切り捨てについて説明しています。\n"
"このガイドでは、[backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate)のキーワード引数`p_norm`について学びます。この引数を使うと、切り捨てられたPauli項によって生じる誤差の推定に用いるLpノルムを変更できます。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Construct an example circuit {#construct-an-example-circuit}"
msgstr "サンプル回路を構築する {#construct-an-example-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide uses the same example circuit as in the [Truncate Pauli terms](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/truncate-operator-terms) guide:\n"
msgstr "このガイドでは、[Truncate Pauli terms](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/truncate-operator-terms)ガイドと同じサンプル回路を使用します。\n"

